<title>USA: HEARx receives two new Florida contracts.</title>
<headline>HEARx receives two new Florida contracts.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>HEARx Ltd said Thursday that it signed new contracts with Health Plans of America Inc and Preferred Medical Plans Inc.</p>
<p>The value of the contracts were not disclosed.</p>
<p>HEARx, which operates over 60 company-owned centers in Connecticut, Florida, New Jersey, New York, Oregon and Virginia, provides hearing care. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
